#. 苗木っち、俺とオメーって意外と仲良しだべ。
#. こうやって、よく話してるしな。
msgctxt "0001 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I'm surprised how well you and me get along, Makoto!\n"
"Seems like we hang out all the time these days."
msgstr ""

#. それが…どうかしたの？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Is...that a bad thing?"
msgstr ""

#. いや、そんな風に仲良しな苗木っちに、
#. 何か恩返し出来ねーかなと…
msgctxt "0003 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Oh, no, not at all! And since we're such good friends,\n"
"can I ask you something...?"
msgstr ""

#. あぁ！　思い付いた！
#. 偶然にも思い付いてしまったぞー！
msgctxt "0004 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Wait! I totally realized something just now,\n"
"completely out of nowhere!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだか…芝居がかってるな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I feel like I'm about to see the performance of a\n"
"lifetime...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木っち…
#. なんだか今日は元気なかったな？
msgctxt "0006 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Say, Makoto... Have you been feeling down in the\n"
"dumps? No energy, no spark?"
msgstr ""

#. え、そう…？
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? You think so...?"
msgstr ""

#. あー、隠さなくてもいいんだ。
#. 俺にはわかるんだ、そういうのが。
msgctxt "0008 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Oh, you don't have to hide it from me. I know what\n"
"it's like, I've been there!"
msgstr ""

#. そんな苗木っちにオススメなのが…
msgctxt "0009 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "And you know what I'd recommend?"
msgstr ""

#. これだべ！
msgctxt "0010 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "This!"
msgstr ""

#. 何…これ…？
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What is it...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>水晶玉<CLT>だべ。
msgctxt "0012 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "A <CLT 3>crystal ball<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. で、この水晶玉がどうしたの…？
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Okay...and?"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木っち、ちょっと持ってみ？
#. ほれほれ。
msgctxt "0014 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Just hold on to it for a second! Here, here!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンは半ば無理矢理、
#. ボクに水晶玉を持たせると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Completely against my will, Hiro shoved the crystal\n"
"ball into my hands.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. どうだい？　ひんやりしてて、
#. 気持ちがいいべ？
msgctxt "0016 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Whaddya think? Nice and cool to the touch. Feels good,\n"
"doesn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そうだね…
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "A-Actually...yeah."
msgstr ""

#. パワーを感じるだろ？
msgctxt "0018 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "You can feel its power, can't you?"
msgstr ""

#. 感じる…のかな…？
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hmm...*do* I feel it...?"
msgstr ""

#. それこそ太古のアースパワーだべ！
msgctxt "0020 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "It's the ancient power of our timeless Mother Earth!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. その水晶玉はな、苗木っち…
msgctxt "0022 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "You see, that crystal ball has quite the history..."
msgstr ""

#. かのアトランティス大陸から発掘された物で、
#. この地球上に、たった一つしかない貴重品なんだぞ？
msgctxt "0023 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"It was found in the ruins of Atlantis! It is literally\n"
"a priceless one-of-a-kind artifact!"
msgstr ""

#. 持つ者に多大なるパワーを与え、
#. 安心と成功をもたらしてくれるという逸品なんだ。
msgctxt "0024 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"This precious item grants enormous power to whoever\n"
"holds it, bringing prosperity and peace of mind!"
msgstr ""

#. かつては、ナポレオンやチンギスハン、
#. かのワシントンなども手にしていた事で知られている。
msgctxt "0025 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"This very ball has known the touch of Napoleon,\n"
"George Washington, even Genghis Khan!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>な、なんて言うか…
#. ここまでうさん臭い話は初めてだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I think that's probably the single most unbelievably\n"
"unbelievable thing I've ever heard...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. そいつをな、苗木っちにプレゼントしよう。
msgctxt "0027 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Well, I'd like to give it to you as a present!"
msgstr ""

#. その代りだな、ここから出た後で、
#. ちょっくら<CLT 3>“あるセミナー”<CLT>に参加して欲しいんだ。
msgctxt "0028 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"In return, I'd like you to come with me to a little\n"
"<CLT 3>seminar<CLT> when we get out of here."
msgstr ""

#. 安心してくれ。参加費は安くしてやる。
#. 他ならぬ苗木っちだからな！
msgctxt "0029 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"And don't worry! I'll see about getting a discount on\n"
"your entry fee. Cuz that's what friends do!"
msgstr ""

#. あ、ありがたい話だけど、
#. ボク、そういうのはちょっと…
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Th-That's really nice of you and all, but I'm not sure\n"
"I'm really interested..."
msgstr ""

#. いや！　その水晶玉は、
#. すでにオメーを持ち主と認めてる！
msgctxt "0031 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Sorry! The crystal ball has already acknowledged you\n"
"as its proper owner!"
msgstr ""

#. 水晶玉自身が苗木っちの元に留まりたいと言ってんべ！
#. だから、もう苗木っちのモンだ！！
msgctxt "0032 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"It wants to stay with you. It NEEDS to stay with you!\n"
"It has given itself to you!"
msgstr ""

#. その代わり、セミナーの約束は守れよ！
#. 破ったら水晶玉の呪いが怖いからな！！
msgctxt "0033 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"So now you gotta keep your promise! You don't wanna\n"
"know what that thing does to oath breakers..."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、よろしくなっ！！
msgctxt "0034 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Okay, I'm countin' on ya, pal!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンは一方的に水晶玉を押し付けたまま、
#. その場から去っていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Refusing to take back the crystal ball, Hiro hurried\n"
"away...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その去り際にぶつぶつと
#. <CLT><CLT 3>『これでノルマ達成』<CLT><CLT 4>とか呟いていたのが気になった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I could hear him mumbling to himself, and caught\n"
"something about \"<CLT><CLT 3>finally made my quota<CLT><CLT 4>\"...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 気のせい…だといいけど…
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I really hope I heard him wrong..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>葉隠康比呂の<CLT><CLT 3>通信簿<CLT><CLT 23>に、今の情報を追記致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Hiro's <CLT><CLT 3>Report Card<CLT><CLT 23> has been updated based on your\n"
"experience with him.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>おめでとうございます。
#. スキル<CLT><CLT 3>“水晶玉占い”<CLT><CLT 23>を獲得致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>You just unlocked the skill <CLT><CLT 3>Crystal Prediction<CLT><CLT 23>!\n"
"Give yourself a pat on the back. You've earned it!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクはいったん、自分の部屋に戻る事にした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I decided to go back to my room for a while...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
